Subject: [PATCH 051/190] misc: xilinx-ai-engine: Enables aie2ps sysfs

commit dd88c1cc7f82473022ff78eccad59008060e8083 from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Enables aie2ps sysfs status dump to allow userspace tools to capture
aiengine status.

Signed-off-by: Keerthanna Mohan <keerthanna.mohan@amd.com>
